  "body": "# SVC for Lunar Client\n\n**SVC for Lunar Client** is a lightweight modpack that allows you to use Simple Voice Chat on Lunar Client.\n\n_Note: We recommend using [**Lunar Client**](https://lunarclient.com/download) to gain the best experience while using this modpack, however it can be launched on any modpack loader._\n\n## Modpack Content\n\n* **Simple Voice Chat**: A working voice chat in Minecraft.\n* **Sodium**: Modern rendering engine which greatly improves performance.\n* **Iris**: Modern shaders mod for Minecraft, compatible with OptiFine shader packs.\n* **Fabric API**: Adds common hooks and intercompatibility measures.\n* **Mod Menu**: Adds a mod menu to view an in-game list of all the mods you have installed.\n\n## FAQ\n\n<details>\n<summary>How do I install the SVC modpack on Lunar Client?</summary>\n\n<center><b>Here are the five easy steps you need to take!</b></center>\n\n### Step 1: Download Lunar Client\n[![Lunar Client Download Grid](https://cmsassets.lunarclientcdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/quality=85,format=auto/assets/edcac7cc5f-lunar-client-download-grid.png)](https://www.lunarclient.com/download)\n\n### Step 2: Select \"Versions\" on the Lunar Client Launcher\n[![Lunar Client Launcher](https://cmsassets.lunarclientcdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/quality=85,format=auto/assets/bbe073a641-launcher-versions-tab.png)](https://www.lunarclient.com/news/mod-loading-on-lunar-client)\n\n### Step 3: Click \"Modpacks\" on the top of the page\n[![Lunar Client Modpacks](https://cmsassets.lunarclientcdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/quality=85,format=auto/assets/13915e6116-lunarclient-modpacks-page.png)](https://www.lunarclient.com/news/mod-loading-on-lunar-client)\n\n### Step 4: Install your modpack of choosing, in this case the SVC for Lunar Client Modpack.\n[Lunar Client Modpack Installer](https://www.lunarclient.com/news/mod-loading-on-lunar-client)\n\n### Step 5: Click \"Launch Game\" after the install is complete!\n[Lunar Client Launch Button](https://www.lunarclient.com/news/mod-loading-on-lunar-client)\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\nConnect with fellow SVC enthusiasts and stay in the loop with latest updates in our [Discord](https://lunarclient.com/discord).",
